{"title": "Lasso Man", "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"druid-infobox druid-container noexcerpt\" id=\"druid-container-1\"><div><div class=\"druid-title\">Lasso Man</div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div class=\"druid-main-image\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-labels druid-tabs\"><div class=\"druid-main-images-label druid-tab druid-toggleable druid-title-tab focused\" data-druid=\"1-1\" data-druid-tab-key=\"In-Game\">In-Game</div></div><a href=\"/wiki/File:Lasso_Man.jpg\" class=\"image\"><img alt=\"Lasso Man.jpg\" src=\"/images/thumb/Lasso_Man.jpg/250px-Lasso_Man.jpg?ac70d0\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"250\" height=\"141\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/Lasso_Man.jpg/375px-Lasso_Man.jpg?ac70d0 1.5x, /images/thumb/Lasso_Man.jpg/500px-Lasso_Man.jpg?ac70d0 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Information\">Information</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-VariantOf\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-VariantOf\">Variant Of</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-VariantOf druid-data-nonempty\">\nJester</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-InternalID\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-InternalID\">Internal ID</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-InternalID druid-data-nonempty\">\nLassoMan</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-MaxCount\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-MaxCount\">Max Count</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-MaxCount druid-data-nonempty\">\n1</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-PowerLevel\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-PowerLevel\">Power Level</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-PowerLevel druid-data-nonempty\">\n3</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-CauseofDeath\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-CauseofDeath\">Cause of Death</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-CauseofDeath druid-data-nonempty\">\nMauling</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-IsBodyRecoverable\" data-druid-section-row=\"Information\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-IsBodyRecoverable\">Is Body Recoverable?</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-IsBodyRecoverable druid-data-nonempty\">\nYes</div></div></div><div class=\"druid-section-container\"><div data-druid-section=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-section druid-section-Stats\">Stats</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Health\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Health\">Health</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Health druid-data-nonempty\">\nUnkillable</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-Damage\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-Damage\">Damage</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-Damage druid-data-nonempty\">\nInstant Kill</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-DoorSpeedMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-DoorSpeedMultiplier\">Door Speed Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-DoorSpeedMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n0.5</div></div><div class=\"druid-row druid-row-StunTimeMultiplier\" data-druid-section-row=\"Stats\"><div class=\"druid-label druid-label-StunTimeMultiplier\">Stun Time Multiplier</div><div class=\"druid-data druid-data-StunTimeMultiplier druid-data-nonempty\">\n0.6</div></div></div></div>\n<p>The <b>Lasso Man</b> is a hostile entity and variant of the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Jester\">Jester</a> added by <b>Wesley's Ememy Variants</b>. This entity is not to be confused with the other appearances of the <b>Lasso Man</b> in the <a href=\"/wiki/Art_Gallery\" title=\"Art Gallery\"><b>Art Gallery</b></a> and the unused vanilla entity <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://lethal.miraheze.org/wiki/Lasso_Man\">Lasso</a>. To add to this confusion, both entities seem to share the same Internal ID, though Wesley's variant can also be referred to generally as <b>RunningLasso</b>.\n</p><p>Regardless, the <b>Lasso Man</b> is a tall humanoid creature made of red rope and string. Its head and the ends of its arms are circular and used as nooses to kill players.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Mechanics\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Mechanics\">&gt; Mechanics</span></h2>\n<p>Unlike the Jester, the <b>Lasso Man</b> will almost immediately enter its chasing state after spawning regardless of if it actually has seen a player or not. It will chase the closest player and instantly kill them on contact. However, its maximum speed is significantly reduced, only being a bit faster than a player walking.\n</p><p>After all players leave the interior, the <b>Lasso Man</b> will roam around the interior at a significantly reduced speed until spotting another player. The <b>Lasso Man</b> has a following timer and cranking timer of 1 second, meaning it will almost immediately enter its chasing state again after seeing another player.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Spawn_Chances\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Spawn_Chances\">&gt; Spawn Chances</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Lasso Man</b> is primarily encountered in the <a href=\"/wiki/Art_Gallery#&gt;_Event:_Lost_Corridors\" title=\"Art Gallery\"><b>Lost Corridors</b></a> event in the <b>Art Gallery</b>, where it is guaranteed to spawn from the painting in the reward room after a player passes a trigger point at and near the door leading into the room.\n</p><p>The <b>Lasso Man</b> can also naturally spawn on a few moons, though this should be taken with a grain of salt given the confusion surrounding its Internal ID as well as the vanilla Lasso, who is also in each of these tables, being incapable of spawning without commands or external modifications.\n</p>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Moon Name</th>\n<th>Interior or Exterior</th>\n<th>Spawn Chance\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Hyx\" title=\"Hyx\">Hyx</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>1.57%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Filitrios\" title=\"Filitrios\">Filitrios</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>1.27%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Desolation\" title=\"Desolation\">Desolation</a></td>\n<td>Interior</td>\n<td>0.63%\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Bestiary_Entry\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Bestiary_Entry\">&gt; Bestiary Entry</span></h2>\n<p>Players must enter \"lassoman\" as one word to access this entry, as the terminal will only register the word \"lasso\" and attempt to display the vanilla Lasso entry otherwise.\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Lasso man <span style=\"padding-left:0.5em;\">&#x2060;</span>\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<table style=\"border: 15px solid #8E8E83; font-size: 135%; font-family: Tomorrow; color: #01A801; border-spacing: 0px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"padding: 25px; background-color: #151515;\">Lasso man<br /><br />[No information about this entity was found.]\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Audio\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Audio\">&gt; Audio</span></h2>\n<div class=\"noresize\">\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" style=\"text-align: center;\" data-expandtext=\"\u25bc\" data-collapsetext=\"\u25b2\">\n<caption style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">Audio\n</caption>\n<tbody><tr>\n<th>Action</th>\n<th>Sound\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stepping</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"LassoManStep.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/LassoManStep.mp3?783fdb\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/LassoManStep.mp3/LassoManStep.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"2\" data-mwtitle=\"LassomanStep2.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/LassomanStep2.mp3?f94133\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/LassomanStep2.mp3/LassomanStep2.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio><br /><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"1\" data-mwtitle=\"LassomanStep3.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/LassomanStep3.mp3?fb37c3\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/LassomanStep3.mp3/LassomanStep3.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Aggroing</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"5\" data-mwtitle=\"LassoAnger.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/LassoAnger.mp3?77a728\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/LassoAnger.mp3/LassoAnger.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Chasing</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"9\" data-mwtitle=\"LassoAngryLoop.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/LassoAngryLoop.mp3?7ab752\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/LassoAngryLoop.mp3/LassoAngryLoop.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Killing a Player</td>\n<td><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"4\" data-mwtitle=\"LassoKillPlayer.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/LassoKillPlayer.mp3?a273e8\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/LassoKillPlayer.mp3/LassoKillPlayer.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Trivia\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Trivia\">&gt; Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>While the <b>Lasso Man</b> does technically have a full cranking song, it will not be heard normally in-game due to the cranking duration lasting a second.</li></ul>\n<p><audio controls=\"\" preload=\"none\" width=\"320\" style=\"width:320px;max-width:100%;max-height:100%\" data-durationhint=\"41\" data-mwtitle=\"LassoWait.mp3\" data-mwprovider=\"local\"><source src=\"/images/LassoWait.mp3?9cd9b5\" type=\"audio/mpeg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /><source src=\"/images/transcoded/LassoWait.mp3/LassoWait.mp3.ogg\" type=\"audio/ogg; codecs=&quot;vorbis&quot;\" data-transcodekey=\"ogg\" data-width=\"0\" data-height=\"0\" /></audio>\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\".3E_Gallery\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"&gt;_Gallery\">&gt; Gallery</span></h2>\n<ul class=\"gallery mw-gallery-traditional\">\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ArtGalleryLostCorridorsRoom.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Lasso Man in the painting in the Lost Corridors.\"><img alt=\"The Lasso Man in the painting in the Lost Corridors.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ArtGalleryLostCorridorsRoom.jpg/120px-ArtGalleryLostCorridorsRoom.jpg?30523c\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ArtGalleryLostCorridorsRoom.jpg/180px-ArtGalleryLostCorridorsRoom.jpg?30523c 1.5x, /images/thumb/ArtGalleryLostCorridorsRoom.jpg/240px-ArtGalleryLostCorridorsRoom.jpg?30523c 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Lasso Man in the painting in the Lost Corridors.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:ArtGalleryLassoManChase.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Lasso Man chasing a player.\"><img alt=\"The Lasso Man chasing a player.\" src=\"/images/thumb/ArtGalleryLassoManChase.jpg/120px-ArtGalleryLassoManChase.jpg?6497a6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/ArtGalleryLassoManChase.jpg/180px-ArtGalleryLassoManChase.jpg?6497a6 1.5x, /images/thumb/ArtGalleryLassoManChase.jpg/240px-ArtGalleryLassoManChase.jpg?6497a6 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Lasso Man chasing a player.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n\t\t<li class=\"gallerybox\" style=\"width: 155px\"><div style=\"width: 155px\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"thumb\" style=\"width: 150px;\"><div style=\"margin:16px auto;\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:LassoManStunned.jpg\" class=\"image\" title=\"The Lasso Man being stunned.\"><img alt=\"The Lasso Man being stunned.\" src=\"/images/thumb/LassoManStunned.jpg/120px-LassoManStunned.jpg?d544b6\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"120\" height=\"68\" srcset=\"/images/thumb/LassoManStunned.jpg/180px-LassoManStunned.jpg?d544b6 1.5x, /images/thumb/LassoManStunned.jpg/240px-LassoManStunned.jpg?d544b6 2x\" data-file-width=\"1920\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div></div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"gallerytext\">The Lasso Man being stunned.</div>\n\t\t</div></li>\n</ul></div>", "images": ["Lasso_Man.jpg", "ArtGalleryLostCorridorsRoom.jpg", "ArtGalleryLassoManChase.jpg", "LassoManStunned.jpg", "LassoManStep.mp3", "LassomanStep2.mp3", "LassomanStep3.mp3", "LassoAnger.mp3", "LassoAngryLoop.mp3", "LassoKillPlayer.mp3", "LassoWait.mp3"], "cats": ["Pages_with_DRUID_infoboxes"]}